  101–200	₹3/unit
  201–300	₹5/unit
  Above 300	₹7/unit
Code:
    n = int(input("Enter the Units Consumed:"))
    if(n>=0) and (n<=100):
      print("Bill Amount:",2*n)
    elif(n>100) and (n<=200):
      print("Bill Amount:",3*n)
    elif(n>200) and (n<=300):
