6.Get a number from the user and determine whether it is prime or not.
Code:
    n = int(input("Enter a Number:"))
    if(n<=1):
        print(n," is not a Prime Number.")
    else:
        for i in range(2,n):
            if(n%i == 0):
                print(n," is not a Prime Number.")
                break
            
        else:
            print(n," is a Prime Number.")

